WEBVTT

00:11:59.537 --> 00:12:01.371
So I say to you now,

00:12:01.412 --> 00:12:03.579
if there's any art you want to create,

00:12:03.621 --> 00:12:06.912
if there's something in your heart,
if you have something to say,

00:12:06.954 --> 00:12:08.371
we need you now.

00:12:09.746 --> 00:12:12.246
Your art can be activism.

00:12:12.287 --> 00:12:15.871
It can inspire people
and change the world.

00:12:15.912 --> 00:12:17.412
If you're afraid, that's OK.

00:12:17.454 --> 00:12:19.121
Just don't let it stop you.

00:12:19.162 --> 00:12:22.287
Go make art and scare a dictator.

00:12:23.912 --> 00:12:25.162
Is art worth it?

00:12:25.912 --> 00:12:27.662
Hell yeah.

00:12:27.704 --> 00:12:28.954
Thank you.